            "review_title": "Review at Ha Ky Crab Noodles soup",
            "review_text": "alan l\n1 contribution\n0\nWorst experience ever\nJul 2026 • Couples\nDine here with my wife for 5-6 times, food is ok above average but getting worse this time, service is also getting worse and worse which I can't stand anymore. The menu has something without prawns and crab only pork slices which I quite like. Last two times I ordered and staff told me it's not available because their pork slices only for more expensive items which have crab meat, prawns. If the shop doesn't want to offer the lower cost items then take it off the menu or set time limits, time is precious, I don't want to go to your store and you tell me this. Stop wasting people time\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nIf you want to try something decent but not over price don't come here.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 21, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
