            "review_title": "Review at Ha Ky Crab Noodles soup",
            "review_text": "Simon L\n13 contributions\n0\nAuthentic Bánh Canh Cua Near Bến Thành Market at a Great Price\nJun 2026 • Family\nJust a short walk from Bến Thành Market, this Bánh Canh Cua restaurant is a wonderful place to enjoy one of Vietnam’s signature seafood noodle dishes.\n\nThe crab noodle soup is rich, flavorful, and naturally sweet from fresh crab and seafood. The thick bánh canh noodles are perfectly chewy, and each bowl comes with generous portions of crab meat, shrimp, quail eggs, and other fresh toppings. Every bite feels authentic, hearty, and satisfying.\n\nThe restaurant itself is very clean, cozy, and comfortable, making it a pleasant place to sit down and enjoy your meal. The staff are friendly, attentive, and provide warm service throughout the experience.\n\nWhat stands out even more is the reasonable price for such a high-quality and filling meal. It’s excellent value for money, especially considering the fresh ingredients and central location.\n\nWhether you’re a local or a tourist exploring the area around Bến Thành Market, this spot is definitely worth visiting for an authentic Vietnamese seafood experience.\nRead more\nWritten June 15, 2026",
